{
  "slug": "githubclip",
  "name": "Githubclip",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "GitHub-backed agent orchestration for Claude Code. githubclip routes work by issue labels into persona-based agents (Orchestrator, CEO, and workers), runs heartbeat cycles against GitHub Projects, posts structured progress comments, and updates issue/project state automatically.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**, **1 agent**, **3 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `heartbeat` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"run a heartbeat\", \"run the agent loop\", \"process…), `heartbeat-log` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"show heartbeat log\", \"heartbeat history\", \"what has githubclip…), `init` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"initialize githubclip\", \"set up githubclip\", \"githubclip init\", \"configure…), `persona-create` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"create a persona\", \"add a new persona\", \"set…), `persona-import` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"import a paperclip agent\", \"convert paperclip to githubclip\",…), `persona-list` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"list personas\", \"show personas\", \"what personas are configured\",…), `status` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"check githubclip status\", \"show agent status\", \"what is…)\n- **Agents** (1): `orchestrator` (Orchestrator agent for githubclip)\n- **Commands** (3): `githubclip-init` (Initialize githubclip in this repo (config, personas, GitHub Project fields, labels)), `githubclip-status` (Show githubclip status (queue, blocked issues, last heartbeat)), `heartbeat` (Run a githubclip heartbeat cycle (pick up issues, do work, report))\n- **Hooks** (1): `hooks.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install githubclip@claude-community` from `gvzq/githubclip`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
